/Title (Traditional bond issuance is slow, expensive, and limited to large deal sizes. Banks rely on legacy credit frameworks that underserve smaller, fast-growing, or non-traditional borrowers. The result is a massive debt capital gap with no modern infrastructure to serve it.)
